cture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>It's All In The Wrists</b> is a passive feature that makes the weapon easier to throw and deals extra damage when thrown.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon has the <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> property and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage when thrown. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rebound_Battleaxe\" title=\"Rebound Battleaxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Battleaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rebound_Battleaxe\" title=\"Rebound Battleaxe\">Rebound Battleaxe</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715162608\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1157/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11365/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2730/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive pa